aristotle-politics-3.logic.r2: argue/scope: A2: read with the obligation on its consequent alone, citizen_virtue_both → O citizen_masters_both, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, O(citizen_virtue_both → citizen_masters_both), C (S6) does not follow: it needs the ought on the consequent alone (narrow scope), not only on the conditional (wide), and which the sentence means decides the argument
